			"Message": "docs(Maintain): Simplify and restructure README for clarity\n\nComplete rewrite of the README to present a cleaner, more professional document. Remove decorative HTML table headers, branding elements, and the heavy multi-column funding section. Consolidate the Core Architecture Principles table into inline prose under a new 'In the Land Project' section. Collapse the 'Key Features' callout, 'Deep Dive & Component Breakdown', and 'See Also' sections into a single 'Key Components' table with direct file-path references and a concise related-links list.\n\nCorrect the LICENSE badge URL from /tree/ to /blob/ format for consistency with project conventions. Strip trailing emoji decorations from section headings for a uniform visual style. Replace the HTML-powered funding acknowledgements with a plain markdown table and inline prose that credits NLnet, NGI0, and PlayForm.\n\nThe result is a shorter, scannable README that conveys the same information with less visual noise and faster load times.",
